<!-- Section 5.2 -->
<h2>5.2 Overview of the User Interface</h2>

<p>The user interface (UI) is part of a software program or device that users see and interact with. It controls how users use the program or website and how information appears on the screen. UI focuses on making the design clear, easy to use, and visually appealing so users have a better experience. The system will be used by two primary types of users: Admin/Staff (Administrators and Plumbers) and Customers.</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 30%;">Use Case</th>
            <th style="width: 70%;">Details</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Login</strong></td><td>Admin/Staff and Customers can login into the system by using a registered email and password.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Account</strong></td><td>Admin/Staff and Customers can manage user accounts (create, view, update, and delete) with details such as name, email, phone number, address, and password.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Booking</strong></td><td>Customers can create, view, and cancel booking appointments with details such as service type, date, time slot, problem description, and attachments; Admin/Staff can view, update booking status, and assign plumbers.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Payment</strong></td><td>Customers can create payment entries by uploading deposit receipts and view payment statuses; Admin/Staff can review, approve, or reject payment receipts and update verification statuses.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Refund</strong></td><td>Customers can initiate refund requests upon booking cancellation and view refund statuses; Admin/Staff can view, process refund settlements, and upload proof transfer slips.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Job Record</strong></td><td>Plumbers/Staff can log completed service job records (create, view, and update) with details such as completion date, total cost, replaced parts, and service notes; Customers can view their job completion summaries.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Generate Report</strong></td><td>Admin/Staff can generate and view business performance analytics, revenue reports, booking count statistics, and monthly sales performance charts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Feedback</strong></td><td>Customers can submit ratings, review comments, and feedback photos for completed jobs; Customers and Admin/Staff can view feedback review boards and staff replies.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Manage Chat & Communication</strong></td><td>Customers and Admin/Staff can send and view real-time chat messages for active booking sessions, and view system push notifications for real-time status updates.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

